# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Without this, directly loading or refreshing a deep
# link like epl.candorsolutions.us/438107 404s -- Cloudflare Pages serves static files
# by exact path match by default, and there's no actual /438107 file on disk. This tells
# it to serve index.html for any path that isn't a real static asset, so React Router
# (added 2026-08-14 for league-id-in-URL routing) gets to handle the route client-side
# instead. Vite copies everything under public/ to the dist/ root unchanged at build
# time, so this file ends up at dist/_redirects, which is where Cloudflare Pages expects it.
/*    /index.html   200
